  "body": "I solved the thumbnail() issue this way:\r\n\r\n```\r\n<         heif = pillow_heif.thumbnail(heif, max(opts.width, opts.height))\r\n---\r\n>         heif.to_pillow().thumbnail((opts.width, opts.height))\r\n```\r\n\r\nThis is my heic.txt file:\r\n```\r\n[ART ImageIO]\r\nLabel=HEIC\r\nExtension=heic\r\nReadCommand=bin/heic_wrapper.sh\r\nFormat=float\r\n```\r\n\r\nI don't have a proper solution for the bit_depth yet, I just hard coded it:\r\n\r\n```\r\nheif.bit_depth = 8\r\n```\r\n\r\nAll my HEIC files are now shown in the file browser.\r\n\r\n",
